cards Lines

box alice as Alice
box shop as Shop

item p1 as Payment #1 in alice, shop [amount: 30 USD]

step Call
  say A line goes from a column id to a card id with ->, and the name goes after the :.
  alice -> p1: Pay

step Receive
  say The line leaves the column head and lights the edge of the card it calls.
  shop -> p1: Receive
